OL,3,ATerminally ill mum who can't talk, walk
OL,4,Aor dress herself refused Pip payment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA terminally ill mum who has been given
OL,7,Fthree years to live has been denied
OL,8,Fdisability benefit despite being unable
OL,9,Fto eat, talk, dress or use the toilet
OL,10,Findependently.
OL,12,FRachael Field, 56, from Rhondda Cynon
OL,13,FTaf, who has tongue cancer, was first
OL,14,Fdiagnosed six years ago.
OL,16,FShe uses a feeding tube, has had her
OL,17,Ftongue and voice box removed, and had
OL,18,Fher windpipe reconstructed using chest
OL,19,Ftissue. Field also has mobility issues.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
