OL,3,ATerminally ill mum who can't talk, walk
OL,4,Aor dress herself refused Pip payment
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, she was denied
OL,7,FPersonal Independence Payment (Pip), to
OL,8,Fsupport people with disability-related
OL,9,Fextra costs.
